proposals.beats:
TopTierPrep's Today's Plan card:
- covers plan tasks only, and every task is ticked by hand ('Mark task as done');
- has no homework (their /my-classes is hidden from the sidebar and absent from the dashboard), no spaced review of fixed mistakes, and vocab on a separate page;
- gives no single minute total across the QOTD, the plan and vocab, which compete on the page;
- sends the student back to the dashboard after each task.

Ours puts everything owed today in one list and one time budget, with zero ticks. The next item is offered on the finish screen of the one just done, so it takes 0 extra taps.
